<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Top Stories</title><subtitle type="html">Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Top Stories</subtitle><id>https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-top</id><updated>2026-10-14T13:52:58Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss-en-top" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.dw.com/english/?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><link rel="via" href="https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-top" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>Germany news: Merz sets out EU priorities after urging reforms</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:af59c61a5977f19df52c8a5883abe3b3ead4dd3c4fdf4ee6cd7b63ee0b17da87</id><updated>2026-10-14T13:52:29Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T12:34:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-merz-sets-out-eu-priorities-after-urging-reforms/live-79656436--ba515100a40c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-merz-sets-out-eu-priorities-after-urging-reforms/live-79656436?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Chancellor Merz gave a major policy statement. Meanwhile, a Ukrainian man is going on trial in Hamburg in the case of a 2022 attack on major gas pipelines. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Houthis launch fresh wave of missiles across Saudi Arabia</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0f6086d3e54f394a792cbe2dada36143c089b3cde6854f9acc0d96fc3d56db5b</id><updated>2026-10-14T13:51:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T13:35:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/houthis-launch-fresh-wave-of-missiles-across-saudi-arabia/live-79655805--282cc2e9726c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/houthis-launch-fresh-wave-of-missiles-across-saudi-arabia/live-79655805?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Both the Houthis and the Saudi-led coalition carried out strikes targeting energy infrastructure. Four people were injured as a result of debris of intercepted missiles in Riyadh. DW has the latest.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>China's influence in the gaming industry is growing</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:dde3abb0b99299d2b1d2a9387714d3581718379939af01081fa8b67aa7bc3b65</id><updated>2026-10-14T13:52:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T11:48:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/china-s-influence-in-the-gaming-industry-is-growing/a-79484755--447380e7608a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/china-s-influence-in-the-gaming-industry-is-growing/a-79484755?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Home to more than 700 million gamers, China is the world's largest gaming market — but it's also one of the most tightly regulated. The effects reach far beyond China, impacting players around the world.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Nord Stream: Germany puts suspected Ukrainian pipeline saboteur on trial</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1a2f36fc9a9715c9f7b751846c461cf6e2774b025678a5ed129cb1a0ce63c3d9</id><updated>2026-10-14T13:51:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T11:40:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/nord-stream-germany-puts-suspected-ukrainian-pipeline-saboteur-on-trial/a-79647617--ad974b48960d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/nord-stream-germany-puts-suspected-ukrainian-pipeline-saboteur-on-trial/a-79647617?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A Ukrainian citizen faces court in Hamburg, accused of attacking the Nord Stream gas pipelines in 2022. It raises questions about Kyiv's possible role in the explosions. German support for Ukraine is also under scrutiny.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Ukraine says Musk's SpaceX limits Kyiv's Starlink access</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5219f734de26f9bf9eb520f2d4a723152a4298afefe490c077deed46a0fccd99</id><updated>2026-10-14T13:52:34Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T11:07:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ukraine-says-musk-s-spacex-limits-kyiv-s-starlink-access/a-79658015--d9d4086f4f7a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ukraine-says-musk-s-spacex-limits-kyiv-s-starlink-access/a-79658015?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Ukraine accused SpaceX of restricting use of its Starlink system, impacting Kyiv's ability to control its drones as Russian attacks continue unabated.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Trump's US Super Intelligence Force and AI czar Jay Clayton</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2333b52c85087c45feb1b2fb1e231c605e7ccf6f820a98c3391fdb284b5c2662</id><updated>2026-10-14T13:52:37Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T10:58:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/trump-s-us-super-intelligence-force-and-ai-czar-jay-clayton/a-79598001--d724a886df86.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/trump-s-us-super-intelligence-force-and-ai-czar-jay-clayton/a-79598001?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Trump announced a new Super Intelligence task force with the White House AI czar Jay Clayton in charge of a group responsible for making sure the US leads international competition in artificial intelligence development.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Trump announces plans for major oil, gas and mineral exploration in Greenland</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a41f10213df6ae51068b7da0614057c4e8e56ef75460cb8c2606c76248104a51</id><updated>2026-10-14T13:52:40Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T10:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/trump-announces-plans-for-major-oil-gas-and-mineral-exploration-in-greenland/a-79656889--25eef0012d41.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/trump-announces-plans-for-major-oil-gas-and-mineral-exploration-in-greenland/a-79656889?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The US president has claimed Greenland holds vast and easily accessible oil reserves without providing evidence or details. His announcement follows a deal expanding the US military presence on the Arctic island.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Fact check: Misleading graph about alleged Russian bot activity</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a90a665efba2e5d02eadf968fdc314e9589a546ba7caafb30738299321ef6e00</id><updated>2026-10-14T13:52:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T09:08:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/fact-check-misleading-graph-about-alleged-russian-bot-activity/a-79651769--ec259de6b65a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/fact-check-misleading-graph-about-alleged-russian-bot-activity/a-79651769?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Did attacks on Russian data centers reduce bot activity around Germany's AfD? A viral graph claims they did. But it contains significant inconsistencies and provides no evidence to support the claim.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Do non-German nationals commit more crimes than Germans?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b409965364b59433a9e52a13eea17eb7a634a330e0ccfb9dda6c249957658639</id><updated>2026-10-14T13:52:46Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T08:48:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/do-non-german-nationals-commit-more-crimes-than-germans/a-79657273--07f237eb177a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/do-non-german-nationals-commit-more-crimes-than-germans/a-79657273?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">People without German passports appear more frequently in German police crime statistics than German nationals. A new study explains why.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>FIFPRO report highlights growing pains in women's football</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:55b145bddeb662bc970e0e47d8181298a3ae0946bc43e7cee8bf72225f06c6f6</id><updated>2026-10-14T13:52:50Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T08:21:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/fifpro-report-highlights-growing-pains-in-women-s-football/a-79648013--365fa34aee7b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/fifpro-report-highlights-growing-pains-in-women-s-football/a-79648013?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Expected global revenue of over $1 billion and new faces at the U17 World Cup show women's football is booming, but a recent report also highlights need for better structures globally.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>The hidden treasure in discarded wearable and fast tech</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:609a042276fd9e00b033a32a00151a86f614057dc80e226bc83307f53ec03076</id><updated>2026-10-14T13:52:52Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T06:52:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/the-hidden-treasure-in-discarded-wearable-and-fast-tech/a-79649611--7010f2eed048.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/the-hidden-treasure-in-discarded-wearable-and-fast-tech/a-79649611?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Sales of fast tech like mini fans and disposable e-vapes, as well as wearable health tech such as heart monitors and smartwatches are soaring. They're creating a new e-waste problem but are full of hidden treasure.</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>Iran: Political infighting deepens as economic woes mount during war</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:72916f10a56c27eed7acab10fc35e241ef0c9377d7cab14f91b52c5b96f01168</id><updated>2026-10-14T13:52:55Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T05:30:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/iran-political-infighting-deepens-as-economic-woes-mount-during-war/a-79654461--e42dac42e7a4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/iran-political-infighting-deepens-as-economic-woes-mount-during-war/a-79654461?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Hardliners are stepping up pressure on Iran's government and calling for Foreign Minister Abbas Araghchi's removal. The oil minister resigned, but that's doing little to ease the pressure on President Masoud Pezeshkian.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>India news: 'Cockroach' leaders sent to judicial custody amid protest crackdown</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:cf3442887a7dd980eeb825f18584321d58fd8c1b2a647a2462692cf1da586c10</id><updated>2026-10-14T13:52:58Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T05:08:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-news-cockroach-leaders-sent-to-judicial-custody-amid-protest-crackdown/live-79656344--74c790a24516.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-news-cockroach-leaders-sent-to-judicial-custody-amid-protest-crackdown/live-79656344?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Three of India's Cockroach movement leaders will spend five days in jail over charges of trespassing into what was until recently a designated protest site. In other news, Marco Rubio is set to visit India.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>US judge extends media outlets' White House access</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:685beb8ee75b2e697a97d2c003b41df1f001c25497f58ac3a0874b02ac3a41a2</id><updated>2026-10-14T13:51:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T03:46:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-judge-extends-media-outlets-white-house-access/a-79656346--409618a7f130.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-judge-extends-media-outlets-white-house-access/a-79656346?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A federal judge extended an order that blocks the Trump administration from banning media outlets from the White House. The outlets have reasonable grounds to think they'll win the case, the judge said.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Cornell suspends frat parties after gang rape case</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:aa3608c57ad494e88a8cf7c5f91eade4c52b38208a1c32242079ff0cbf00bebb</id><updated>2026-10-14T13:51:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-13T22:58:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/cornell-suspends-frat-parties-after-gang-rape-case/a-79655735--4025361fcd6c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/cornell-suspends-frat-parties-after-gang-rape-case/a-79655735?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Cornell said no parties will be held at frat houses until the end of the academic year. The university is trying to mend its reputation following its handling of a gang rape case in 2024.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>OpenAI says employee caught planting listening device</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a9629b3673c479145e280ed1c3644916eb39ba6ff4034c0c0449b220c1bd4f6d</id><updated>2026-10-14T13:51:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-13T21:24:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/openai-says-employee-caught-planting-listening-device/a-79655491--3ffcbc60cb62.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/openai-says-employee-caught-planting-listening-device/a-79655491?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A Saudi national employed by the artificial intelligence lab has been arrested after a listening device was planted in a company conference room.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Vatican confirms Pope Leo underwent surgery for lung cancer</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f722193e5c2ea02913d74ae68b3809b4da5635d6ddedab8ad441fdeb8de039dc</id><updated>2026-10-14T13:51:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-13T19:50:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/vatican-confirms-pope-leo-underwent-surgery-for-lung-cancer/a-79647264--a67818faad6d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/vatican-confirms-pope-leo-underwent-surgery-for-lung-cancer/a-79647264?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The pope has had part of his lung removed and is recovering after surgery. Leo has been unusually candid for a pontiff about his health issues, disclosing the surgery to thousands of people in St. Peter's Square.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Tupac Shakur murder trial: Former gang leader Duane Davis sentenced to 40 years</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:80b65733413f1877dec2d84e1bea96c1e9503ca85e3a61db2345d452a726a2dc</id><updated>2026-10-14T13:51:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-13T19:40:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/tupac-shakur-murder-trial-former-gang-leader-duane-davis-sentenced-to-40-years/a-79655189--19baf3060f40.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/tupac-shakur-murder-trial-former-gang-leader-duane-davis-sentenced-to-40-years/a-79655189?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Former Los Angeles gang leader Duane "Keffe D" Davis was found guilty of ordering the killing of hip-hop icon Tupac Shakur.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Left-leaning Berlin coalition talks break down</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9f775870d242902ffe8a16bd39880981720aad3b53f27c22b7c5e527c5b781de</id><updated>2026-10-14T13:51:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-13T19:22:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-left-leaning-berlin-coalition-talks-break-down/live-79647092--70d338313c8a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-left-leaning-berlin-coalition-talks-break-down/live-79647092?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The SPD and Greens in Berlin have halted exploratory coalition talks with the Left Party amid a dispute over Israel policy and antisemitism. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Ukraine allies in Poland after Starlink sabotage, Trump diesel deal</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:14e2450315f69255e97c76aca14b10e3878238ee1880c8c801d54c8e697fd701</id><updated>2026-10-14T13:51:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-13T18:52:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ukraine-allies-in-poland-after-starlink-sabotage-trump-diesel-deal/a-79653869--c0d0565fa8d8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ukraine-allies-in-poland-after-starlink-sabotage-trump-diesel-deal/a-79653869?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Germany's Johann Wadephul said hybrid plots like the Starlink fire showed Europe was "in Russia's crosshairs." The UK's Ed Miliband said Trump's Russian diesel deal led to a "very difficult few days" diplomatically.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Ukraine and the US: What's next after Trump's diesel deal with Russia?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a6930ab2a4ad88664f640b1c31aaf54a53fbbdb6a55b1ef2306b38ff75e4a6a9</id><updated>2026-10-14T13:51:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-13T18:51:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ukraine-and-the-us-what-s-next-after-trump-s-diesel-deal-with-russia/a-79650785--59d833db4bc6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ukraine-and-the-us-what-s-next-after-trump-s-diesel-deal-with-russia/a-79650785?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Donald Trump plans to allow the purchase of Russian diesel, drawing criticism at home and abroad. What is behind the US president's decision and what should Ukraine do next? DW spoke with experts.</summary><category term="World" /></entry></feed>
